{
  "tema": 6501,
  "slug": "durmiendo-leyendo-gerundios-irregulares",
  "titulo": "Irregular gerunds",
  "subtitulo": "Está durmiendo. ¿Qué estás leyendo?",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "Some gerunds are irregular: -ir verbs with a stem change use e > i or o > u (pidiendo, durmiendo), and verbs whose stem ends in a vowel use -yendo instead of -iendo (leyendo, oyendo, yendo).",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Regular gerunds end in **-ando** (-ar) or **-iendo** (-er, -ir). Three groups change."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**1. -ir verbs with e > i**: the **e** of the stem becomes **i**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Infinitive",
            "Gerund"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "pedir",
              "**pidiendo**"
            ],
            [
              "decir",
              "**diciendo**"
            ],
            [
              "servir",
              "**sirviendo**"
            ],
            [
              "sentir",
              "**sintiendo**"
            ],
            [
              "seguir",
              "**siguiendo**"
            ],
            [
              "venir",
              "**viniendo**"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**2. o > u**: **dormir → durmiendo**, **morir → muriendo**, and also **poder → pudiendo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**3. Stem ending in a vowel**: **-iendo** becomes **-yendo**, because an **i** between two vowels turns into **y**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Infinitive",
            "Gerund"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "leer",
              "**leyendo**"
            ],
            [
              "creer",
              "**creyendo**"
            ],
            [
              "traer",
              "**trayendo**"
            ],
            [
              "caer",
              "**cayendo**"
            ],
            [
              "oír",
              "**oyendo**"
            ],
            [
              "construir",
              "**construyendo**"
            ],
            [
              "ir",
              "**yendo**"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Reír** and **freír** lose an **i**: **riendo**, **friendo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: for most of these, the gerund changes the same vowel as the preterite **él** form: **pidió → pidiendo**, **durmió → durmiendo**, **leyó → leyendo**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
